{
  "id": "A59",
  "goal": "INC04-R07-C2-MAINTAINED-BOUND-OUTPUT-001",
  "title": "Runtime bound output: the opt-in boundProfile reserve, its stored bounds echo, and the apply / claim / outcome steps for research, design and source review",
  "why": [
    "SOPHIA-INC-2026-11 INC-04 R07 C2, the maintained crossing (Root81, migration 0115). The generated output is regenerated with `pnpm --filter @sophia/contracts generate`, never by hand. A57, A58 and 0113 are unchanged.",
    "A tracked model reserve may carry boundProfile {profileId, revision}: a reference only, never a number the service applies. Its closed binding then echoes bounds, exactly the stored 0113 reply; without the opt-in the request, reply and binding are byte-identical to A58.",
    "Nine paths, one per operation and step, carry the closed apply, claim and outcome bodies in camelCase; the project, runtime and (apply) attempt come from the authenticated scope, never the body. apply is a receipt, claim the only send permission, outcome informational.",
    "Default off at both layers: an API built without the bound-output option refuses a boundProfile before any effect and serves none of the nine paths; the database wrappers additionally require the transaction-local selection that only such an API sets, which is feature selection, never authority."
  ],
  "patch": [
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/components/schemas/ResearchReserveRequest/properties/boundProfile",
      "value": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "description": "C2 (A59): opt this NEW tracked model reservation into its qualified per-reservation dimension bounds, by profile reference only. Never a bound, a ceiling or maxTokens: the service derives every bound from the registered profile and policies. Accepted only by an API built with the bound-output option; otherwise refused before any effect, never downgraded.",
        "properties": {
          "profileId": {
            "type": "string",
            "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{8}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{12}$"
          },
          "revision": {
            "type": "string",
            "pattern": "^[1-9][0-9]{0,9}$",
            "description": "A decimal string (the 0113 parser refuses a JSON number)."
          }
        },
        "required": ["profileId", "revision"]
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/components/schemas/ResearchReservation/properties/binding/properties/bounds",
      "value": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "description": "Echoed only for a reservation that opted in with boundProfile (A59): the STORED server-derived bounds of its one dispatch, exactly as recorded at reserve (0113), never recomputed. A digest is consistency, never authority.",
        "properties": {
          "dispatchId": {
            "type": "string",
            "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{8}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{12}$"
          },
          "profileId": {
            "type": "string",
            "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{8}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{12}$"
          },
          "profileRevision": {
            "type": "string",
            "pattern": "^[1-9][0-9]{0,9}$"
          },
          "authorizeSetDigest": {
            "type": "string",
            "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{64}$"
          },
          "originalGeneration": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "string",
                "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{64}$"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ]
          },
          "items": {
            "type": "array",
            "minItems": 4,
            "maxItems": 4,
            "items": {
              "type": "object",
              "additionalProperties": false,
              "properties": {
                "dimension": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "enum": [
                    "openai.input_cached_tokens",
                    "openai.input_tokens",
                    "openai.model_requests",
                    "openai.output_tokens"
                  ]
                },
                "unit": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "enum": ["tokens", "requests"]
                },
                "boundKind": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "enum": ["authorized", "unsupported"]
                },
                "bound": {
                  "anyOf": [
                    {
                      "type": "string",
                      "pattern": "^(0|[1-9][0-9]{0,9})$"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "null"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                "enforcementKind": {
                  "anyOf": [
                    {
                      "type": "string",
                      "enum": ["output_parameter", "dispatch_count"]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "null"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                "policySetDigest": {
                  "anyOf": [
                    {
                      "type": "string",
                      "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{64}$"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "null"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                "unsupportedReason": {
                  "anyOf": [
                    {
                      "type": "string",
                      "enum": ["input_estimate_only", "no_enforcing_mechanism", "route_not_qualified"]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "null"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                "authorizeDigest": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{64}$"
                }
              },
              "required": [
                "dimension",
                "unit",
                "boundKind",
                "bound",
                "enforcementKind",
                "policySetDigest",
                "unsupportedReason",
                "authorizeDigest"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "required": ["dispatchId", "profileId", "profileRevision", "authorizeSetDigest", "originalGeneration", "items"]
      }
    },
